    type_5_duration: [0, "seconds"],
    type_6_duration: [1, "minute"],
    desc: "You manifest a minor wonder within range. You \
           create one of the effects below within range. If you \
           cast this spell multiple times, you can have up to \
           three of its 1-minute effects active at a time.",
    type_1: "***Altered Eyes.*** You alter the appearance of your \
             eyes for 1 minute.",
    type_2: "***Booming Voice.*** Your voice booms up to three \
             times as loud as normal for 1 minute. For the dura- \
             tion, you have Advantage on CHA (Intimidation) checks."
    type_3: "***Fire Play.*** You cause flames to flicker, brighten, \
             dim or change color for 1 minute.",
    type_4: "***Invisible Hand.*** You instantaneously cause an un- \
             locked door or window to fly open or slam shut."
    type_5: "***Phantom Sound.*** You create an instantaneous \
             sound that originates from a point of your choice \
             within range, such as a rumble of thunder, the cry \
             of a raven, or ominous whispers.",
    type_6: "***Tremors.*** You create harmless tremors in the \
             ground for one minute.",
